# Comprehensive QA after critical changes

Unit tests (`npm test`) are necessary but **not sufficient** for billing, generation quality, studio UX, and marketplace flows.

## When to run full QA

After changing any of:

- `src/lib/metering.ts`, `convex/tokens.ts`, `convex/lib/plans.ts`, `convex/billing.ts`
- `src/app/api/generate/**` (create, samples, refine, gesture, app-assets, remix)
- `src/lib/generate-system-prompt.ts`, `src/lib/refine-pack.ts`, `src/lib/token-pricing.ts`
- `src/components/generated-studio.tsx`, create/library/marketplace/remix pages
- `src/components/mascots/**` (factories / example poses)
- `convex/marketplace*.ts`, pricing/onboarding flows

## Required workflow

1. Run `npm test` (full suite when billing/generation touched).
2. Open and follow **`docs/comprehensive-qa.md`** — execute every checklist section that matches your diff.
3. For billing changes: verify balance before/after via `api.tokens.balance`; confirm failure/abort paths charge **0**; confirm success `_meta.tokens` + `_meta.balance` reconcile.
4. For generation/prompt changes: compare output quality to the **same-family example pack** (orb/lantern/bird/robot) — production bar in the doc.
5. For studio changes: exercise themes, instrument, parts, gestures, export, Ask AI, add gesture, and app assets on **created**, **remixed**, and **bought** mascots where applicable.
6. Record sign-off using the template at the bottom of `docs/comprehensive-qa.md` in your PR or handoff.

## Do not skip

- Live balance reconciliation (Convex query or UI)
- Abort / failure → no charge (refine & gesture)
- Large packs (37+ poses) not blocked below 64 cap
- App icon generation at least once per app-assets change

If dev servers or Clerk sandbox are unavailable, say so explicitly and list what was not verified.
